    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In SAM0, experience a unique card-based Roguelike battle.</strong> Play as an AI relic of human civilization, exploring planets, making choices, and managing resources. Face diverse organic and mechanical foes, unlock the tech tree, open packs to build your deck, and unravel the mystery of why humanity left this planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687740/extras/e5ce4054b9f71feaf2b75a261d115eaa.avif?t=1752928354\" width=616 height=225 /></span><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 primary elements plus 3 sub-elements for deep tactical synergy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely combine 100+ cards to strategize pre-combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random routes, events, and battles ensure endless freshness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrades through tech trees and resource investments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize gameplay with chip power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich narrative fragments across events, enemy bios, and environmental storytelling</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687740/extras/eaa3fce50bf4e6f9c7202324045293c7.avif?t=1752928354\" width=616 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In SAM0, <strong>no strategy is off-limits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own path and conquer the game with your distinct playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687740/extras/10026727381cedacabfc0e9636dc2a3b.avif?t=1752928354\" width=616 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300cTheDarkxOrlik\u300dis a two-person graduate  team (Lead Programmer + Lead Artist handling all development). Aware of our scale limitations, we focus intensely on perfecting the core mechanics. While content volume may be modest, every game system undergoes serious and detailed testing. Your understanding and feedback are vital to our refinement.<br><br>BUG REPORT\uff1a<strong><a href=\"mailto:thedarkxorlik@163.com\">thedarkxorlik@163.com</a></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In SAM0, experience a unique card-based Roguelike battle.</strong> Play as an AI relic of human civilization, exploring planets, making choices, and managing resources. Face diverse organic and mechanical foes, unlock the tech tree, open packs to build your deck, and unravel the mystery of why humanity left this planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687740/extras/e5ce4054b9f71feaf2b75a261d115eaa.avif?t=1752928354\" width=616 height=225 /></span><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 primary elements plus 3 sub-elements for deep tactical synergy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely combine 100+ cards to strategize pre-combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random routes, events, and battles ensure endless freshness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrades through tech trees and resource investments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize gameplay with chip power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich narrative fragments across events, enemy bios, and environmental storytelling</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687740/extras/eaa3fce50bf4e6f9c7202324045293c7.avif?t=1752928354\" width=616 height=224 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In SAM0, <strong>no strategy is off-limits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own path and conquer the game with your distinct playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687740/extras/10026727381cedacabfc0e9636dc2a3b.avif?t=1752928354\" width=616 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300cTheDarkxOrlik\u300dis a two-person graduate  team (Lead Programmer + Lead Artist handling all development). Aware of our scale limitations, we focus intensely on perfecting the core mechanics. While content volume may be modest, every game system undergoes serious and detailed testing. Your understanding and feedback are vital to our refinement.<br><br>BUG REPORT\uff1a<strong><a href=\"mailto:thedarkxorlik@163.com\">thedarkxorlik@163.com</a></strong></p>",
